[0.23585, "o", "╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\r\n║       Claude Code Go SDK - Permission Control Demo         ║\r\r\n╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\r\n\r\r\nThis demo showcases permission and tool control features:\r\r\n  • Permission modes (default, acceptEdits, bypass)\r\r\n  • Tool allowlisting with glob patterns\r\r\n  • Tool blocklisting for security\r\r\n  • Preset configurations for common use cases\r\r\n\r\r\n✓ Applied 'readonly' preset\r\r\n\r\r\nð Permission Commands:\r\r\n  /mode default     - Standard permission checks\r\r\n  /mode acceptEdits - Auto-approve file edits\r\r\n  /mode bypass      - Bypass all checks (dangerous!)\r\r\n  /allow <pattern>  - Add to allowed tools list\r\r\n  /deny <pattern>   - Add to disallowed tools lis"]
[0.235884, "o", "t\r\r\n  /clear allowed  "]
[0.235916, "o", "  - Clear allowed tools list\r\r\n  /clear denied     - Clear disallowed tools list\r\r\n  /callback on|off  - Enable/disable permission callback\r\r\n  /decision <d>     - Set callback decision (allow/deny/ask)\r\r\n  /tools            - Show current tool permissions\r\r\n  /presets          - Show preset tool configurations\r\r\n  /preset <name>    - Apply a preset configuration\r\r\n  /status           - Show current permission status\r\r\n  /help             - Show this help\r\r\n  exit              - Exit the demo\r\r\n\r\r\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\r\r\n│ Mode: default      | Callback: false  | Decision: allow      │\r\r\n│ Allowed: 6         | Disallowed: 4                                   │\r\r\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.235941, "o", "───┘\r\r\n"]
[0.235992, "o", "\r\r\n>>> "]
[0.23606, "o", "/presets\r\r\n\r\r\nð§ Available Presets:\r\r\n  readonly  - Only read operations (Read, Bash(ls/cat/pwd))\r\r\n  safe      - Safe operations (no writes, no network)\r\r\n  git       - Git operations only\r\r\n  full      - All standard tools\r\r\n  minimal   - Absolute minimum (Read only)\r\r\n\r\r\n>>> "]
